OL,3,GNEWSADog that hunts invasive 'sea
OL,4,Avomit' honoured as animal of the year
OL,5,
OL,6,FA working dog from the Scottish
OL,7,FHighlands has been named animal of the
OL,8,Fyear by a charity for hunting down an
OL,9,Finvasive marine creature called the
OL,10,Fcarpet sea squirt.
OL,12,FThis organism, also nicknamed "sea
OL,13,Fvomit", is particularly harmful to
OL,14,Fcoastal wildlife and economies.
OL,16,FWorking at low tide with her owner, Dr
OL,17,FTexa Sim, black Labrador Sgiath has
OL,18,Ffound hundreds of colonies of the sea
OL,19,Fsquirt, which - if left uncontrolled -
OL,20,Fcan smother and kill native species.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,427,420,260,160,0,100
